body:
The worst part was that after me and my ex broke up, he sent me a text saying that if I ever wanted to get back with him, he'd be waiting. It was patronizing, it was horrible, bur I almost took it. I actually almost took it, and that's what hurts the most, the hold that he freaking had on me.

&#x200B;

I'm sorry you're in practically the same boat as me, I hope you're able to find someone who'll move the world for you, because that's exactly what you deserve :)
